      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_3",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Haldric and his companions find themselves before the Ka’lian, or the Council of Elven Lords."),
          },
          {
            tag: "switch",
            variable: "num_done",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "case",
                equals: 0,
                children: [
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lord Logalmier",
                    text: _("Dionli, why have you brought these humans before us?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lady Dionli",
                    text: _("They are of the same people as the Prince of Southbay. They come as refugees. I can see a use for them."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lord Aryad",
                    text: _("What use would that be? What need could we have for the shortliveds here?"),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lady Dionli",
                    text: _("The dwarves have come to the Brown Hills. While they live long, even they grow like weeds when in an empty field. There is trouble brewing."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lady Dionli",
                    text: _("It is better to be the greater of three than the lesser of two. The Prince of Southbay was good, he was a credit to his people. Maybe these ones are made of the same stuff."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lord El'Isomithir",
                    text: _("But why then do they come as refugees? Speak, human."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Prince Haldric",
                    text: _("Our people come in peace. There was a war in our homeland. We are refugees. We come seeking a new home, since our island to the west and north is now forfeit."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lord El'Isomithir",
                    text: _("So you come to steal our land? We know your kind, humans of the west-north."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Prince Haldric",
                    text: _("We only wish to live in peace. The dwarves are peoples of mountain and hill, the elves are people of the forests, we only seek some of the space in between."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lady Dionli",
                    text: _("I suggest that we grant these humans the plains to the north and south of the Great River."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lord Aryad",
                    text: _("They should be put to the test before such a grant is made."),
                  },
                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Lord El'Isomithir",
                    text: _("A quest for each of us then?"),
                  },
